</comment>
                            <comment id="17875717" author="JIRAUSER294653" created="Thu, 22 Aug 2024 02:55:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Design of &quot;Optimized the execution time of deletion tasks&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13071032/13071032_5953.png&quot; height=&quot;277&quot; width=&quot;563&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Every value needs to be updated once, and each update takes three or four seconds. When many partitions are checked at the same time, the cumulative time is very long. So, we need collect all the partitions to be deleted, reorg them to a large partition, and just update the delta log once.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17875720" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 22 Aug 2024 03:03:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;liyang-kylin merged PR #2194:&lt;br/&gt;
URL: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/kylin/pull/2194&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/kylin/pull/2194&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

</comment>
                            <comment id="17875721" author="jira-bot" created="Thu, 22 Aug 2024 03:03:30 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Commit 508fe2e366da5382ee5b388a97347c0ff33ccb3d in kylin&apos;s branch refs/heads/kylin5 from Zhimin Wu&lt;br/&gt;
[ &lt;a href=&quot;https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf?p=kylin.git;h=508fe2e366&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf?p=kylin.git;h=508fe2e366&lt;/a&gt; ]&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5953&quot; title=&quot;Minor bugs of InternalTable [FollowUp KYLIN-5948]&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;KYLIN-5953&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;KYLIN-5953&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Minor bugfixes of InternalTable&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A followUp issue of &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5948&quot; title=&quot;Support internal table&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;KYLIN-5948&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;KYLIN-5948&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;br/&gt;
1. Add table properties for internal table list&lt;br/&gt;
2. Optimized delta delete&lt;br/&gt;
3. Restore build script&lt;br/&gt;
4. Skip validation only if source table is empty&lt;br/&gt;
5. Optimized the execution time of deletion tasks&lt;br/&gt;
6. Set jobName for internal table job&lt;br/&gt;
7. Bugfix empty internal table update&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;---------&lt;br/&gt;
